For every part with "polarised": true, check that each pin names a net and that
the nets make electrical sense (e.g. a flyback diode's cathode on the positive
rail, an LED's anode towards the supply, a MOSFET's source on ground for a
low-side switch).

{{ ref('parts') | tojson(indent=2) }}

Fail if any polarised part is missing pin nets or has a pin on the wrong net.
Reply with only valid JSON: {"results": "pass"} or {"results": "fail"}.
